  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provincial and Rural Infrastructure Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective is to assist the Kingdom of Cambodia to enhance the livelihood of the peoples residing in the provinces of Kampong Thomcomma Oddar Meancheycomma Preah Vihear and Siem Reap by providing sustainable access to markets and essential services through (i) a program of road rehabilitation and maintenance; (ii) a program of capacity building and training; and (iii) development of improved public policies and strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
